  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2502.01 After Market Tinting Restriction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2502.01 After Market Tinting Restriction. No motor vehicle registered in New Hampshire shall be sold, inspected, or driven on any way in New Hampshire which has after market tinting as defined in Saf-C 2501.01 except as allowed by RSA 266:58-a or this chapter.\n\nSource. #4974, eff 11-13-90; ss by #6204, eff 3-15-96, EXPIRED: 3-15-04\n\nNew. #8072, eff 4-23-04; ss by #10083, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13416, eff 7-25-22; ss by #14218, INTERIM, eff 3-25-25; ss by #14382, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
